OL,3,GNEWSAPayment warning after #37k builder
OL,4,A'nightmare'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple who paid #37,000 towards a
OL,7,Fconservatory that was never finished
OL,8,Fare warning others of the pitfalls
OL,9,Fafter they spent years trying to
OL,10,Frecover their money.
OL,12,FGeorgina and Ferdinand Boucher, who
OL,13,Fused a bank transfer to pay their
OL,14,Fbuilder for a project that was never
OL,15,Fcompleted at their home in Devon, say
OL,16,Fthey learnt the hard way that some
OL,17,Fpayment methods may offer more
OL,18,Fprotection.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
